    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1612240/extras/8004f9b25f11fb05eb874883154f9eef.avif?t=1748648094\" /></div><br><br>The Neon Raver Gang, LSD, has taken control of Smugtopia, turning the majority of the population into mindless ravers. Style your way with diving bullet time mechanics, super fast sliding, rocket jumping and much more discoverable tech! Trespass onto enemy territory with complete complacency including underground raves, abandoned skyscrapers, and more! Take back Smugtopia from the Neon Raver Gang known as LSD smugfully.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Insanely Smug Techniques</strong>:</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1612240/extras/f240a172622ca33cfa2ba8e0f32ab042.poster.avif?t=1748648094\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1612240/extras/f240a172622ca33cfa2ba8e0f32ab042.webm?t=1748648094\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1612240/extras/f240a172622ca33cfa2ba8e0f32ab042.mp4?t=1748648094\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong>Dive</strong> into death-defying bullet time and <strong>Slide</strong> into the DM's at high speed dispatching enemies like a human bowling ball with physics focused gameplay.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Super Score Rush</strong></h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1612240/extras/b8f74f3a6250f480b7d26954a0344bea.poster.avif?t=1748648094\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1612240/extras/b8f74f3a6250f480b7d26954a0344bea.webm?t=1748648094\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1612240/extras/b8f74f3a6250f480b7d26954a0344bea.mp4?t=1748648094\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Challenge fellow Smugglers in a race against time and style with the <strong>Speedrun Mode</strong>. Full integration with Steam Leaderboard lets you pit yourself with Friends and the World<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Be your own hero</strong></h2>With <strong>VRM support</strong>, recruit your own characters into the SmugForce.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Lethal Weaponry</strong></h2>Customizable guns with tweakable parameters make every tool viable.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Pro Gamer Options</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Ultrawide, 16:9, 16:10, and 4:3 support<br></li><li>Gamepad + Steam Deck compatible<br></li><li>Remappable Key and Gamepad Bindings<br></li><li>Plethora of accessibility options<br></li><li>Video Options, FPS Cap, Quality Settings<br></li><li>Steam Cloud Cross Save for on-the-go Smugging</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1612240/extras/8004f9b25f11fb05eb874883154f9eef.avif?t=1748648094\" /></div><br><br>The Neon Raver Gang, LSD, has taken control of Smugtopia, turning the majority of the population into mindless ravers. Style your way with diving bullet time mechanics, super fast sliding, rocket jumping and much more discoverable tech! Trespass onto enemy territory with complete complacency including underground raves, abandoned skyscrapers, and more! Take back Smugtopia from the Neon Raver Gang known as LSD smugfully.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Insanely Smug Techniques</strong>:</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1612240/extras/f240a172622ca33cfa2ba8e0f32ab042.poster.avif?t=1748648094\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1612240/extras/f240a172622ca33cfa2ba8e0f32ab042.webm?t=1748648094\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1612240/extras/f240a172622ca33cfa2ba8e0f32ab042.mp4?t=1748648094\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong>Dive</strong> into death-defying bullet time and <strong>Slide</strong> into the DM's at high speed dispatching enemies like a human bowling ball with physics focused gameplay.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Super Score Rush</strong></h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1612240/extras/b8f74f3a6250f480b7d26954a0344bea.poster.avif?t=1748648094\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1612240/extras/b8f74f3a6250f480b7d26954a0344bea.webm?t=1748648094\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1612240/extras/b8f74f3a6250f480b7d26954a0344bea.mp4?t=1748648094\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Challenge fellow Smugglers in a race against time and style with the <strong>Speedrun Mode</strong>. Full integration with Steam Leaderboard lets you pit yourself with Friends and the World<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Be your own hero</strong></h2>With <strong>VRM support</strong>, recruit your own characters into the SmugForce.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Lethal Weaponry</strong></h2>Customizable guns with tweakable parameters make every tool viable.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Pro Gamer Options</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Ultrawide, 16:9, 16:10, and 4:3 support<br></li><li>Gamepad + Steam Deck compatible<br></li><li>Remappable Key and Gamepad Bindings<br></li><li>Plethora of accessibility options<br></li><li>Video Options, FPS Cap, Quality Settings<br></li><li>Steam Cloud Cross Save for on-the-go Smugging</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Slide and Dive through enemy bullets inside underground rave parties. Gun down the Neon Raver Gang, LSD, and save Smugtopia in this physics based third-person movement shooter.",
